# Nothing is required to run this build.
#
# The site has no database, no mail service and no paid dependency. Both forms
# hand off to the visitor's own mail client on purpose, and say so on the page.
#
# At launch, mail becomes SMTP through a mailbox Pastrami Joe's already owns.
# When that exists, these are the variables it will want, and Kevin sets them in
# the Vercel dashboard. Never paste a secret into a file in this repo.
#
# SMTP_HOST=
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_USER=
# SMTP_PASS=
# INQUIRY_TO=
